      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why i'm doing this, talking to an AI at 11pm on a tuesday. i just... there's no one to call anymore. my whole friend group was really \"our\" friend group, and after the divorce it just kind of... evaporated. \n\n24 years. i gave 24 years to something that apparently wasn't even real. he's living with her now. moved in already. and i'm sitting in this house that used to feel like a home and now it just feels like a museum of a life that wasn't actually mine.\n\ni don't recognize myself when i look in the mirror. like who is that person? i was his wife for so long i don't know what i am without that. i don't know if there's anything underneath it.",
