      "role": "user",
      "content": "strength lol. i don't feel strong. i feel like a ghost in my own house.\n\ni keep thinking like... who even am i? i was a wife, i was part of a \"we\" for so long. all my plans, everything i imagined for my future, it was all built around him. and now that's just... gone. like the version of me that existed for the last 24 years has died. \n\nsometimes i think i just want to be someone else completely. or no one at all. just... stop being this person who got left. does that make sense? not like in a dramatic way, i just genuinely don't know if there's a \"me\" left underneath all of this.",
